WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.450
Two students sit the same exam.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.280
Both have learnt the same facts
about the philosopher John Hick.

3
00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:10.430
The question: examine
Hick's soul-making theodicy.

4
00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:12.450
Both write for the full time.

5
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.140
One scores far higher than the other.

6
00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:20.940
So if the facts are the same, why does one
score far higher on an explain question?

7
00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:25.140
In this mission, you'll test four kinds
of material against that one question

8
00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:26.100
on Hick.

9
00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:28.380
Then you'll take a model paragraph apart,

10
00:00:28.430 --> 00:00:32.000
label by label, to see what
each sentence is doing.

11
00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:36.680
Your mission: find out why the same
facts can earn such different marks.
